      "title": "O-RAN fronthaul UC-plane dissector",
      "message": "O-RAN fronthaul UC-plane dissector\n\nAlso modified eCPRI dissector to call it for payloads.\nThis dissector will claim the \"IQ Data\" and\n\"Real-Time Control Data\" message types - others are\nstill handled by eCPRI.\n\nFormerly internal to Keysight.\n",
